WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:03.140
A woman has been bleeding for 12 years.

2
00:00:03.190 --> 00:00:05.910
Doctors have only made her worse.

3
00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:08.960
Under the Law, that makes her unclean.

4
00:00:09.010 --> 00:00:13.100
Still, she pushes through the
crowd to touch his clothes.

5
00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:16.780
Meanwhile, a synagogue
leader called Jairus waits.

6
00:00:16.830 --> 00:00:19.110
His little daughter is dying.

7
00:00:19.160 --> 00:00:23.280
And outside Jericho, a blind
beggar sits by the road.

8
00:00:23.330 --> 00:00:26.570
So what did their faith
have to do with healing?

9
00:00:26.620 --> 00:00:31.200
In this mission, you'll see how Mark
wraps one of these stories inside another,

10
00:00:31.250 --> 00:00:32.350
and why.

11
00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:35.340
Then you'll weigh up a
claim: in these stories,

12
00:00:35.390 --> 00:00:38.810
faith matters more than
the miracle itself.

13
00:00:38.860 --> 00:00:42.760
Your mission: find out what their
faith had to do with healing.
